# Paths Opengrep skips in this repository (the thyn-ai/security-toolchain gate
# already excludes node_modules/, build/, dist/, vendor/, .pixi/ and the other
# org-wide directories; this file adds what is specific to mojo-kernels).

# Mojo is a language Opengrep does not parse. The kernels under kernels/*/src
# are covered by the differential test suites (native vs. reference backend),
# not by a pattern scanner. The extension is excluded, not the directory:
# kernels/*/build.sh are real shell scripts and stay in scope.
*.mojo

# Vendored Fuse.js fallback backend -- third-party code, scanned upstream.
typescript/fuse-mojo/packages/core/vendor/
